# Pet Care Application – Project Work Report

## Project Title

**Pet Care Mobile Application**

---

# 1. Introduction

The Pet Care Application is an Android-based mobile application developed to help pet owners manage pet-related activities in one place. The application provides features such as pet adoption, pet product shopping, appointment booking, and account management.

The project was developed using Java and Android Studio with SQLite database integration for storing appointment data locally.

---

# 2. Objective of the Project

The main objectives of this project are:

* To create a user-friendly pet care management application.
* To provide pet adoption details through a mobile platform.
* To allow users to book appointments for pet care services.
* To display pet products and offers in an organized manner.
* To improve user convenience using a simple Android interface.

