# 6. Database Implementation

The project uses SQLite as a local database solution.

## Why SQLite Was Used

* Lightweight database
* Built into Android
* No internet required
* Easy integration for beginners
* Suitable for local appointment storage

## Database Operations Performed

* Insert appointment data
* Retrieve appointment data
* Store user booking information

### Database Helper Class

* `AppointmentDatabaseHelper.java`

